--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 76329f96a0bd36043946dd720240c25c, type: 3}
  m_Name: North v Silas hub world 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data:
    convoName: North v Silas hub world 1
    speakers:
    - North
    - Silas
    lines:
    - character: Silas
      expression: 
      line: "\u2026and that\u2019s when he told her\u2013 "
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: Silas
      expression: 
      line: "\u2013 he\u2019d have to amputate! "
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: 
      expression: 
      line: laughter
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: Silas
      expression: 
      line: 'She fainted so thoroughly, not even my smelling salts could wake her
        up, so we performed the operation right there on the couch! '
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: North
      expression: 
      line: Hah! That's nothing! There was this cadet in my class, real weedy.
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: North
      expression: 
      line: "First assignment, we\u2019re out stopping a hijacked 18-wheeler. Got
        \u2018em pulled over, they're acting innocent, the whole song and dance.
        This kid has the bright idea to stand right next to the rear tire. Up front,
        the perps get spooked and try to floor it outta\u2019 there\u2026 and roll
        the whole rig right over his foot! "
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: Silas
      expression: 
      line: "Oho! I\u2019ll bet that was the last time he ever set foot on the streets! "
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: North
      expression: 
      line: 'Nah, there was enough meat hanging off his leg to patch one back together.
        They laced him up with some prosthetic nerves, and he was back out on the
        force in two weeks. '
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: Silas
      expression: 
      line: 'What a marvel of medical technique! Your people are quite ingenious,
        to devise such wondrous inventions. '
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: North
      expression: 
      line: Yeah, you could say that. Glad as hell it wasn't me, though.
      audio: {fileID: 0}
